WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.833 --> 00:00:03.583
I live in the quarterback film room at

00:00:03.583 --> 00:00:04.833
One Gillette Stadium

00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:07.291
My name is Tom Brady. I'm 40 years old

00:00:07.291 --> 00:00:09.291
I believe in taking care of myself

00:00:09.291 --> 00:00:11.250
in a self-branded diet and achieving

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.000
sustained peak performance

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.666
In the morning, if my face is a little puffy

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:18.666
I'll put on an ice pack modified with my $200

00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:21.250
smartphone app that combines vague inspirational

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.666
quotes with brain games meant for old people

00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:27.458
I'll then apply anti-aging organic eyeblack made from

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:30.166
the ashes of Jimmy Garoppolo's contract extension

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:31.250
Gisele was wrong

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.166
One day I WILL throw AND catch the ball

00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:39.625
I work in the National Football League

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.833
Let's see Rodgers' card

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:43.750
Oh my god

00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:45.916
Look at that subtle mobility

00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:47.916
Tom, are you OK?

00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:50.875
I have all the characteristics of a human being

00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:53.666
but not a single, clear, identifiable emotion

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:55.375
Why are your floors covered with the

00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:57.625
newspapers of your Super Bowl losses?

00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:59.916
Besides KILL, KILL, KILL!

